# slabs: cell_slab_truncation
# Exact readout: fine grid = coarse grid (co = fi). Interpolated readout (a64-style): WFN_fi = a denser NSCF (nbnd = nv+nc+few),
# WFNq_fi = the UNSHIFTED fine WFN for momentum/plotxct (round-8 trap: a shifted WFNq_fi gives incoherent real-space volumes).
# Outputs: absorption_eh.dat (spectrum), eigenvalues.dat (sticks with strengths), eigenvectors.h5 (for plotxct / layer or chain weights).
